    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期简介：成都周末特种兵，逛游黄龙九寨沟，三星堆，金华行程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容大纲：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>：周末特种兵，黄龙风景区</span></p><span></span><p><span>06: 38：岷江源，雪山脚下的湿地公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a>：一天特种兵，九寨沟精华景点行程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>：九寨沟的Y字形左侧风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a>：九寨沟的原始森林，宽松两天行程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>：九寨沟的餐饮和住宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a>：三星堆博物馆，2小时特种兵逛观镇馆之宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频内容在小红书/抖音/B站/视频号：韩Choco</span></p>]]></description>
